<div class="block block-power">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title">
                FDM's POWER
            </div>
            <div class="block-child-description">
                In 12BET, extra rewards are always guaranteed. All you need to do is fulfil the stated New FDM's requirements and receive an extra commission in addition to your commission.
            </div>
        </div>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Promotion/Partial/_FDMsPowerTable.cshtml"); }
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-note">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title title-spcing">
                NOTE
            </div>
            <div class="main-content">
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-description">
                        FDM is new member who successfully made the first deposit. Every affiliate will receive an extra percentage from FDM’s POWER promotion in addition to the Regular Commission they earn.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-example">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title title-spcing">
                THE COMMISSION CALCULATION EXAMPLE:
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Imagine “Affiliate XYZ” has a <span class="red-bold">Net Win/Loss of $35,000</span> and <span class="red-bold">12 FDMs</span> with the <span class="red-bold">total deposit of $3,000</span>. The individual qualifies FDM POWER promotion.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                To calculate the commission, we first apply the Regular Commission, which is 35% of $35,000, resulting in $12,250.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Next, we apply FDM Power to the Regular Commission amount, which is 3%. Therefore, the FDM Power bonus is $367.5, but since the maximum bonus is $250, the commission will be $12,250 + $250 = $12,500.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Thus, the total commission earned by the Affiliate XYZ is $12,500.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

